00:50:27.824 --> 00:50:30.227
ANGELES, BUT SHE IS. SHE'S

00:50:30.293 --> 00:50:30.761
WATCHING TODAY'S CEREMONY

00:50:30.827 --> 00:50:32.329
VIRTUALLY. SHE WAS BORN IN 1927,

00:50:32.396 --> 00:50:34.664
IN BUDAPEST, HUNGARY. SHE WAS AN

00:50:34.731 --> 00:50:35.866
ONLY CHILD, YET SHE NEVER FELT

00:50:35.932 --> 00:50:37.934
ALONE BECAUSE OF THE CLOSENESS

00:50:38.001 --> 00:50:40.337
OF HER EXTENDED FAMILY. UNTIL

00:50:40.404 --> 00:50:41.405
HER TEENAGE YEARS, SHE LIVED A

00:50:41.471 --> 00:50:43.607
HAPPY AND WELL TO DO LIFE,

00:50:43.673 --> 00:50:45.475
FOCUSED ON HER SCHOOLING AND THE

00:50:45.542 --> 00:50:47.144
SIMPLE JOYS OF YOUTH, AND

00:50:47.210 --> 00:50:48.211
LARGELY INSULATED FROM THE

00:50:48.278 --> 00:50:50.514
HORRORS UNFOLDING ACROSS GERM.

00:50:50.580 --> 00:50:51.515
IN OCCUPIED EUROPE, HOWEVER, THE

00:50:51.581 --> 00:50:53.917
RISE OF GERMANY LED TO

00:50:53.984 --> 00:50:55.018
EXCEEDINGLY LIMITING ANTI-JEWISH

00:50:55.085 --> 00:50:58.455
LAWS AND MEASURES IN HUNGARY,

00:50:58.522 --> 00:50:59.589
AND THEY WORSENED WHEN FORCES

00:50:59.656 --> 00:51:01.358
OCCUPIED HER HOMETOWN OF

00:51:01.425 --> 00:51:04.761
BUDAPEST IN 1944, WHEN SHE WAS

00:51:04.828 --> 00:51:05.962
JUST 16 YEARS OLD, HER FATHER

00:51:06.029 --> 00:51:07.664
WAS SUDDENLY TAKEN BY SOLDIERS

00:51:07.731 --> 00:51:10.567
AND WAS NEVER SEEN AGAIN.

00:51:10.634 --> 00:51:11.535
SHORTLY THEREAFTER, EVEN AS

00:51:11.601 --> 00:51:12.602
ALLIED FORCES LANDED ON THE

00:51:12.669 --> 00:51:14.271
BEACHES OF NORMANDY AND GERMANY,

00:51:14.337 --> 00:51:17.374
THEIR DAYS BECAME NUMBERED. MARY

00:51:17.441 --> 00:51:19.476
HER MOTHER, HER GRANDPARENTS,

00:51:19.543 --> 00:51:20.477
ALONG WITH NEARLY 450,000

00:51:20.544 --> 00:51:22.779
HUNGARIAN JEWS, WERE DEPORTED TO

00:51:22.846 --> 00:51:25.715
AUSCHWITZ WITHOUT NOTICE. ONE OF

00:51:25.782 --> 00:51:26.883
THE WILDEST THINGS ABOUT THIS

00:51:26.950 --> 00:51:28.985
WHOLE STORY IS THAT THE GERMAN

00:51:29.052 --> 00:51:30.187
MACHINE WAS SO FOCUSED ON

00:51:30.253 --> 00:51:32.489
KILLING AS MANY JEWS AS

00:51:32.556 --> 00:51:33.590
POSSIBLE, THAT THEY WOULD TAKE

00:51:33.657 --> 00:51:34.691
TRAINS THAT WERE SUPPOSED TO

00:51:34.758 --> 00:51:36.893
SUPPLY THEIR OWN TROOPS ON THE

00:51:36.960 --> 00:51:38.094
RUSSIAN FRONT AND ON THE FRENCH

00:51:38.161 --> 00:51:40.030
FRONT TO FOCUS ON THIS MASS

00:51:40.096 --> 00:51:42.666
SLAUGHTER. SUCH WAS THE SICKNESS

00:51:42.732 --> 00:51:45.902
OF THESE PEOPLE. SHE WOULD SEE

00:51:45.969 --> 00:51:47.003
HER GRANDPARENTS FOR THE FINAL

00:51:47.070 --> 00:51:49.673
TIME UPON ARRIVAL AT THE

00:51:49.739 --> 00:51:50.740
CONCENTRATION CAMP THAT WAS

00:51:50.807 --> 00:51:53.009
MENTIONED BY OUR COLLEAGUE. IN

00:51:53.076 --> 00:51:54.077
THE FOLLOWING MONTHS, MARY WAS

00:51:54.144 --> 00:51:57.047
FORCED TO WEAVE THE SHORN HAIR

00:51:57.113 --> 00:51:59.749
OF FELLOW PRISONERS INTO ITEMS

00:51:59.816 --> 00:52:00.951
FOR THE WAR EFFORT. SHE RECALLS

00:52:01.017 --> 00:52:03.186
IT PRACTICALLY EVERY DAY. SHE

00:52:03.253 --> 00:52:04.287
WOULD WOULD WITNESS SOMEONE

00:52:04.354 --> 00:52:06.756
PERISH BESIDE HER IN THE

00:52:06.823 --> 00:52:08.558
BARRACKS. THE YOUNG GIRLS WOULD

00:52:08.625 --> 00:52:09.559
PROMISE EACH OTHER THAT IF THEY

00:52:09.626 --> 00:52:10.727
SURVIVED THEIR SUBJUGATION, THEY

00:52:10.794 --> 00:52:11.695
WOULD DEDICATE THEIR LIVES TO

00:52:11.761 --> 00:52:12.996
SHARING THEIR STORIES AND

00:52:13.063 --> 00:52:16.099
EDUCATING THE WORLD AS TO THE

00:52:16.166 --> 00:52:17.300
HORRORS THAT HAD TRANSPIRED. IT

00:52:17.367 --> 00:52:20.303
WAS NOT UNTIL THE SPRING OF

00:52:20.370 --> 00:52:21.505
1945, AFTER SHE AND HER MOTHER

00:52:21.571 --> 00:52:23.540
ENDURED THE FAMOUS DEATH MARCHES

00:52:23.607 --> 00:52:24.541
FOLLOWING THE EVACUATION OF

00:52:24.608 --> 00:52:25.809
AUSCHWITZ, THAT THEY WERE

00:52:25.876 --> 00:52:26.943
LIBERATED BY THE RUSSIAN ARMY,

00:52:27.010 --> 00:52:29.045
AND FIVE YEARS AFTER THE END OF

00:52:29.112 --> 00:52:30.914
THE WAR, MARY IMMIGRATED TO LOS

00:52:30.981 --> 00:52:31.615
ANGELES, SETTLING IN THE

00:52:31.681 --> 00:52:32.716
WONDERFULLY DIVERSE NEIGHBORHOOD

00:52:32.782 --> 00:52:34.818
OF BOYLE HEIGHTS. SHE LEARNED

00:52:34.885 --> 00:52:35.952
ENGLISH AT FAIRFAX HIGH SCHOOL,

00:52:36.019 --> 00:52:38.388
MET HER HUSBAND AT A SOCIAL

00:52:38.455 --> 00:52:39.556
EVENT JUST OFF SUNSET BOULEVARD

00:52:39.623 --> 00:52:41.157
NOT LONG AFTER, AND SHE'S NOW A

00:52:41.224 --> 00:52:42.359
RESIDENT OF WEST HOLLYWOOD, MY

00:52:42.425 --> 00:52:44.761
DISTRICT. SHE HAS TWO GROWN

00:52:44.828 --> 00:52:45.862
CHILDREN. SHE CONTINUES TO BE AN

00:52:45.929 --> 00:52:47.130
ACTIVE AND CHERISHED MEMBER OF

00:52:47.197 --> 00:52:48.865
THE LOS ANGELES AND JEWISH

00:52:48.932 --> 00:52:50.333
COMMUNITIES. SHE'S WELL KNOWN IN

00:52:50.400 --> 00:52:52.168
AT THE MUSEUM OF THE HOLOCAUST

00:52:52.235 --> 00:52:54.070
IN LOS ANGELES. AND JUST THIS

00:52:54.137 --> 00:52:56.339
PAST DECEMBER, I MET HER FOR THE

00:52:56.406 --> 00:52:57.507
FIRST TIME. AND WHEN WE WERE

00:52:57.574 --> 00:52:59.476
HAVING A GATHERING THAT INCLUDED

00:52:59.543 --> 00:53:00.544
SURVIVORS OF THE OCTOBER 7TH

00:53:00.610 --> 00:53:01.711
ATTACKS IN ISRAEL AND RELATIVES

00:53:01.778 --> 00:53:03.780
OF THE HOSTAGES TAKEN BY HAMAS

00:53:03.847 --> 00:53:05.882
THAT DAY, AS YOU MIGHT IMAGINE,

00:53:05.949 --> 00:53:06.850
THE DISCUSSION WAS PROFOUNDLY

00:53:06.917 --> 00:53:09.185
MOVING, DEEPLY EMOTIONAL, AND BY

00:53:09.252 --> 00:53:12.689
FAR THE MOST POWERFUL MOMENT OF

00:53:12.756 --> 00:53:15.992
THE MORNING WAS WHEN YOUNG ELLA,

00:53:16.059 --> 00:53:17.193
WHO AT AGE 14, TALKED OF HER

00:53:17.260 --> 00:53:19.863
EXPERIENCES BARRICADED IN HER

00:53:19.930 --> 00:53:22.966
ROOM AT THE KIBBUTZ FOR HOURS

00:53:23.033 --> 00:53:26.703
AND HOURS ON END. IT WAS BY

00:53:26.770 --> 00:53:28.505
HAPPENSTANCE AND BASIC LUCK, AND

00:53:28.572 --> 00:53:30.707
THE ATTACKERS GIVING UP ON

00:53:30.774 --> 00:53:32.943
TRYING TO GET INTO HER SHELTER

00:53:33.009 --> 00:53:34.010
ROOM, THAT SHE SURVIVED. AND

00:53:34.077 --> 00:53:37.080
THEN SHE WAS RUSHED OUT OF HER

00:53:37.147 --> 00:53:39.583
HOUSE ABOUT 32 HOURS INTO THE

00:53:39.649 --> 00:53:40.584
ORDEAL, STEPPING OVER FAMILY

00:53:40.650 --> 00:53:43.253
MEMBERS, THEIR BODIES AND POOLS

00:53:43.320 --> 00:53:51.194
OF BLOOD. DURING THAT EVENT,

00:53:51.261 --> 00:53:52.262
MARY JUMPED UP. SHE'D BEEN

00:53:52.329 --> 00:53:54.364
SITTING IN THE BACK, HADN'T SAID

00:53:54.431 --> 00:53:57.567
A WORD, AND SHE CAME UP TO ELLA

00:53:57.634 --> 00:53:58.735
AND THEY REALIZED THAT THEY WERE

00:53:58.802 --> 00:54:01.071
JUST ABOUT THE SAME AGE THAT

00:54:01.137 --> 00:54:02.305
MARY WAS JUST ABOUT THE SAME AGE

00:54:02.372 --> 00:54:04.541
WHEN SHE WAS DEPORTED TO

00:54:04.608 --> 00:54:05.709
HUNGARY, AS ELLA WAS WHEN SHE

00:54:05.775 --> 00:54:08.244
EXPERIENCED THIS TERRIBLE ACT OF

00:54:08.311 --> 00:54:11.481
VIOLENCE AND DEPRAVITY. THEY

00:54:11.548 --> 00:54:14.718
EMBRACED IN FRONT OF US. IT WAS

00:54:14.784 --> 00:54:16.586
A VERY POWERFUL MOMENT OF SHARED

00:54:16.653 --> 00:54:19.289
PAIN, OF THIS HERITAGE THAT HAD

